<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ENSCO Int'l started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ENSCO Int'l started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Friday analyst John Lavoy had started coverage of ENSCO International Inc with a rating of strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Dallas contract driller closed at 47 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
